,"options":["lay","lays","laying","layed"],"answer":0,"exp":"lay."},{"type":"fill","id":"Harimau adalah pemakan daging.","q":"Tigers are ___.","answers":["carnivores"],"hint":"c _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"carnivores."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kuda memakan rumput.","q":"Horses eat ___.","answers":["grass"],"hint":"g _ _ _ _","exp":"grass."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kucing adalah mamalia.\"","answer":"Cats are mammals.","exp":"are."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Mereka memakan serangga kecil.\"","answer":"They eat small insects.","exp":"eat."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Hewan apa?","say":"They are reptiles and they have sharp teeth","options":["Buaya","Gajah","Burung","Kelinci"],"answer":0,"exp":"reptiles; sharp teeth."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Mereka tinggal di mana?","say":"Whales live in the sea","options":["Di laut","Di hutan","Di gurun","Di gunung"],"answer":0,"exp":"sea."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang dimakan?","say":"Rabbits eat carrots and grass","options":["Wortel dan rumput","Daging","Ikan","Nasi"],"answer":0,"exp":"carrots; grass."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Penguins are birds, but they cannot fly. They live in cold places such as Antarctica. They swim very well and eat fish.\" Pernyataan \"Penguins can fly\" adalah...","options":["Salah","Benar","Tidak disebutkan","Mungkin benar"],"answer":0,"exp":"cannot fly."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca teks di atas. Pernyataan \"Penguins eat fish\" adalah...","options":["Benar","Salah","Tidak disebutkan","Mungkin salah"],"answer":0,"exp":"eat fish."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca teks di atas. Pernyataan \"Penguins are big\" adalah...","options":["Tidak disebutkan","Benar","Salah","Mungkin benar"],"answer":0,"exp":"ukuran tidak disebutkan."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Perbaiki kalimat: \"Bats is mammals.\"","options":["Bats are mammals.","Bats am mammals.","Bat are mammals.","Bats be mammals."],"answer":0,"exp":"Bats are."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Perbaiki kalimat: \"A tiger eat meat.\"","option